# Wave T38 (Driftlog kit): raftfloor — Driftlog Town's registered street kind (the fleet's street kinds carry the -floor suffix; the desire-path tiers key on it). LASHED-LOG STREET: horizontal log courses with staggered end joints, rope lashings wrapping the courses, peg knots — a raft's deck built as a street. Structurally unlike boardwalk's plain parallel planks and Highbranch's lashed plank decks: log courses + rope, at sea level. (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T38-DRIFTLOG-PLAN.md §5.)
